  "body_text": "When life gets ugly\nIt's them\nLOVELY THOUGHTS\nthat make you feel alright\n老铁1岁咯\n啦！啦！啦！\n4.20\n这个神奇的日子\n去年，我们借用它【国际飞行日】的名开了老铁\n今年，我们借着小恐龙的结业，再次庆生\n庆祝老铁1岁\n也庆祝小恐龙即将到来的新生\n老铁的会员们，我们为你准备了插画版挂耳包\n到店【芳华路】记得报个会员号，领一包\n数量有限，发完就完\n感谢大家伙\n继续，做好咖啡\n感谢永璞伙伴的精美插画",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p>\n<mpvoice class=\"rich_pages res_iframe js_editor_audio audio_iframe place_audio_area\" frameborder=\"0\" high_size=\"2027.18\" isaac2=\"1\" low_size=\"496.28\" name=\"LT店歌 - Beautiful Things\" play_length=\"259000\" source_size=\"496.3\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/audio_tmpl&amp;name=LT%E5%BA%97%E6%AD%8C%20-%20Beautiful%20Things&amp;play_length=04:19\" voice_encode_fileid=\"MzI0OTM1NDc3N18yMjQ3NDg1MTU0\">\n</mpvoice>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          When life gets ugly\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          It's them\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<strong>\n           LOVELY THOUGHTS\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          that make you feel alright\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          老铁1岁咯\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          啦！啦！啦！\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          4.20\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这个神奇的日子\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          去年，我们借用它【国际飞行日】的名开了老铁\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今年，我们借着小恐龙的结业，再次庆生\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庆祝老铁1岁\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          也庆祝小恐龙即将到来的新生\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           老铁的会员们，我们为你准备了插画版挂耳包\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           到店【芳华路】记得报个会员号，领一包\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          数量有限，发完就完\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢大家伙\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          继续，做好咖啡\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n8yOeEt0EItRiaOib5icxX3iaexCg1udkssx4Q7k4Ox7VZ1Kg7Q0zh6iaqjDicTwLLL9I2q4V5RoxCg05vw/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n<em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n            感谢永璞伙伴的精美插画\n           </span>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n</div>",
